				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="1624" _ulen="1214" >

ODER_DATE^주문일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ODER_NO^주문번호^11^0^7^0^0^0^0
